photo":"","source":"tmdb"},"40325":{"biography":"Megumi Hayashibara (林原 めぐみ, Hayashibara Megumi, born March 30, 1967) is a Japanese voice actress, singer, radio personality, and lyricist from Tokyo.\n\nShe is currently affiliated with Aksent. Her nicknames include: Megu-san, Megu-nee, Bara-san, Kakka, and Daijin. She is best known for her roles in Ranma ½ (as Ranma Saotome (female voice)), Neon Genesis Evangelion (as Rei Ayanami), Cowboy Bebop (as Faye Valentine), Slayers (as Lina Inverse), Detective Conan (as Ai Haibara), Pokémon (as Musashi/Jessie of Team Rocket), All Purpose Cultural Catgirl Nuku Nuku (as Atsuko Natsume and her counterpart Atsuko Higuchi from the OVA Nuku Nuku Dash!) and Shaman King (as Anna Kyoyama). She is also a fully qualified and registered nurse.","biography_language":"en","birthday":"1967-03-30","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Nyarote (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vqW2SWREor5ULO4wy4ewqnyXR4Y.jpg","title":"Orizzonti Pokémon: La Serie","tmdb_id":220150,"type":"tv","year":2023},{"character":"Drum's app (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/31iHlDe30pudzLfPaAg20H5gJmE.jpg","title":"VIVANT","tmdb_id":218038,"type":"tv","year":2023},{"character":"Kaori Itadori (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zKFkzRn1UyE11Jv9CJjVmvmQFvR.jpg","title":"Jujutsu Kaisen","tmdb_id":95479,"type":"tv","year":2020},{"character":"Rebecca (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8f33Q5AuM2G5ZqFeusbIqDjr3cI.jpg","title":"One Piece","tmdb_id":37854,"type":"tv","year":1999},{"character":"Musashi (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xiM3hQi1XGbT8B9adiKk9cpmlAs.jpg","title":"Pokémon 2 - La forza di uno","tmdb_id":12599,"type":"movie","year":1999},{"character":"Musashi (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uoBwsiZNyOFDBh9WdDhpxc2JERM.jpg","title":"Pokémon","tmdb_id":60572,"type":"tv","year":1997},{"character":"Ai Haibara (voice)","poster":"https://image.t